            <ArticleTitle>[Analysis of the clinical experience with 136 patients with headache treated with lisuride].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1515-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Data on the treatment of 136 patients with essential headache using Lisuride are reported and discussed. The excellent tolerability of the drug and its considerable efficacy even after suspension of treatment are emphasised.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
